  Summary

  Phase 2 Complete: Loop Execution in Behavioral Executor

  Changes made:

  1. Header file (behavioral_program_executor.hpp)
    - Added ISARegisterFile member for loop state and address generation
    - Added statistics for loop_iterations and config_instructions
    - Added AUTO dispatch method declarations
  2. Implementation file (behavioral_program_executor.cpp)
    - Changed run() from simple for-loop to PC-based execution
    - LOOP_BEGIN increments PC and stores loop state
    - LOOP_END either branches back (loop continues) or increments PC (loop done)
    - Implemented SET_* configuration opcodes (SET_TILE_DIM, SET_STRIDE, etc.)
    - Implemented AUTO addressing opcodes that compute addresses from loop indices
    - load_program() now configures address generator with base addresses
